        {
          "text": " Konye ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Kogogonjor, ijo Serubabel; kogogonjor, ijo Yosua, okoku loka Yekosadak, esasedoti lopeti; kogogonjoros, yes ituŋa kere luka akwap; ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Kiswamata: naarai ebala EJAKAIT loka ajoresjo ebe, Ajai eoŋ kayes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
