        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai inera EJAKAIT loka ajoresjo kwanata ebe: Irwan atipet bobo, apak naedit, eianakini akuj, ka akwap, ka aŋolol, ka akwap naconit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
