              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapaaran naka akaisaarei ka nuoŋon kolap lokikanyetekaonon, kokaru lokiareit loka Daŋo, kobu akirot naka EJAKAIT mama ejai Kagai enabi ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Leb 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.33.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ikis 33:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera EJAKAIT loka ajoresjo kwanata ebe: Kinit cani isasedotin nuka ikisila ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Arai kitiŋ ituŋanan akiriŋ nakalaunan katwele naka egoeke, kotiroria emugati, arai atap, arai ebino, arai akinyet, arai akiriŋ kere katweleke, araun kereka ŋin yenikalaunan?’” Kobonokis isasedotin ebe, “Mam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.11+NUM.19.12+NUM.19.13+NUM.19.14+NUM.19.15+NUM.19.16+NUM.19.17+NUM.19.18+NUM.19.19+NUM.19.20+NUM.19.21+NUM.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 19:11-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi Kagai atemar atiar, “Arai ketiro yenimam elai kanuka akuan nakatwan idjopet koboro katjul eraun kereka nin yenimam elai?” Kobonokis isasedotin atiar, “Eraun yenimam elai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TIT.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tit 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi Kagai aboŋokin ebe, “Ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Ikote nen ituŋa lu, ikoni da nen ateker na kakonyeneka; ikoni nen ŋiniswam naka akaninikee; nin yeneinakinete kaŋina erai yenimam elai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAG.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kag 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do, kenainait, koomoomata nuejaunete amear kapaaran kana ape. Eroko idokokino amoru kuju amoru koyekalu loka EJAKAIT: ipotu koiaas biai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameun kapaki kaŋin kere, naabunjo ituŋanan atukit naka aitemisjo akaisaarei, emwaasi do atomon bon; naabunjo ituŋanan acues naka ebino aokun amotii akaisakany, emwaasi do akaisaarei bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
